  "title": "The Stokes phenomenon for the Ramanujan’s q-difference equation and its higher order extension",
  "authors_raw": null,
  "abstract": "We show connection formulae of local solutions of the Ramanu - jan equation between the origin and the inﬁnity. These solut ions are given by the Ramanujan function, the q-Airy function and the diver- gent basic hypergeometric series 2ϕ 0(0, 0; −; q, x ). We use two diﬀerent q-Borel-Laplace resummation methods to obtain our connecti on for- mulae. We also introduce the q-Borel-Laplace transformation of level r−1, which are higher order extension of these transformation s. These methods are useful to obtain an asymptotic formula of a diver gent se- ries rϕ 0(0, 0, . . . , 0; −; q, x ).",
